		"name": "Event Planner - Attendee Service Testing",
		"description": "Comprehensive testing collection for the Event Planner Attendee Service through the API Gateway. This collection includes all attendee management endpoints, registration functionality, and attendee tracking.\n\n## Setup Instructions:\n1. Import this collection into Postman\n2. Set the base URL environment variable (see below)\n3. Follow the testing sequence in order\n\n## Environment Variables:\n- `base_url`: http://localhost:8080 (API Gateway URL)\n- `auth_token`: JWT token from Auth Service (set after login)\n- `attendee_id`: Will be set automatically after creating an attendee\n- `event_id`: Event ID for testing (set manually or from Event Service)\n\n## Testing Sequence:\n1. Start with Health Check\n2. Test Swagger UI access\n3. Test OpenAPI documentation\n4. Test direct access (should fail)\n5. Test X-Internal-Auth mechanism",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "🔍 Health & Status Checks",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Gateway Health Check",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"Gateway is running\", function () {",
									"    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
									"});",
									"",
									"pm.test(\"Response has status UP\", function () {",
									"    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('status', 'UP');",
									"});",
									"",
									"pm.test(\"Response time is acceptable\", function () {",
									"    pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(2000);",
									"});"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/actuator/health",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"actuator",
								"health"
							]
						},
						"description": "Check if the API Gateway is running and healthy."
